{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23562","headline":"早发赴洞庭舟中作 · 白居易","name":"早发赴洞庭舟中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阊门曙色欲苍苍，星月高低宿水光。\n櫂举影摇灯烛动，舟移声拽管弦长。\n渐看海树红生日，遥见包山白带霜。\n出郭已行十五里，唯消一曲慢霓裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}